    "question": "A farm has 5 less than 9 times the amount of hens as roosters.  If there are 75 total chickens, how many hens are there?",
    "gold": "67",
    "answer": "Let x represent the number of roosters\nNumber of hens:9x-5\nTotal:9x-5+x=75\n10x-5=75\n10x=80\nx=<<8=8>>8\nNumber of hens: 9(8)-5=67\n#### 67"
